            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for your review of Grayton House! We're delighted to hear that you found the home spacious and enjoyed the convenience of the pool and golf cart rides. It's wonderful that the location worked well for your stay. We understand that public parking near the beach can sometimes be challenging, and we appreciate your feedback on this. Your insights help us continue to improve the experience for our guests. We hope to welcome you back in the future!",
