            "id": "978e1e87-73a8-4f9a-ba0b-f4b70aa2313f",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for your wonderful review of Grayton House! We’re thrilled to hear that the home was the perfect fit for your group and that the check-in process and communication exceeded your expectations. Our team works hard to ensure a seamless experience for our guests, and it’s great to know we delivered. We're glad you enjoyed the convenience of the golf cart and the prime location—both are certainly guest favorites! We truly appreciate your kind words and hope to welcome you back to Grayton House in the future.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "This place was the perfect size for my group of 7! Check in was so easy and communication with the property manager was a 10/10. The golf cart was also a bonus when picking this house! Location is prime.",
