          {
            "date": "Jun 24, 2025",
            "id": "6dc66e8e-5e66-4b01-8c17-b9024ec3c5a5",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your wonderful review! We're thrilled to hear that you enjoyed your stay at Grayton House and appreciated the little details like the labeled lights and fans. It’s great to know the outdoor shower, location, and golf cart added to your experience. We understand the loft bunk beds might not have been ideal for your teenagers, but we’re glad it didn’t impact your overall stay. Thank you for choosing Grayton House, and we’d love to welcome you back anytime!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Everything was perfect, lots of little details they included like labeling all the lights/fans! Shower outside to rinse off! Location was great, super close to tram and beach and golf cart was fun. The bunk beds are actually in a loft, which I didn’t realize. It wasn’t a big deal, but I had teenagers who all wanted their own room. We enjoyed our stay!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
